Those of you who frequent IRC at the same time as me already know about
this, but one of my lojban ideas finally made it into existence. "le prenu
cu finti" is a short (12 mins) video knocked together with my whiteboard and
webcam. Yes, it is intentional that there is no sound on the video, but if
you think it would benefit from having sound, please feel free to edit it.
If anyone knows any good zifre software for editing videos please let me
know, because there's some pauses in the vid that I'd like to speed up a
bit. I know that the choice of vocab in the vid is sometimes a bit poor, but
it was made up on the spot with only one pause for checking a spelling in
ll. If this is well-received then I'll do some more stuff like it. If you
have ideas I may use, then please let me know.

http://blip.tv/file/1531526/

ni'o

I'm also considering starting a lojban blog (bau la lojban rather than tavla
fi la lojban) so watch this space, but don't hold your breath.

